issues.description:
A pruning condition in count_valid_divisions is incorrect and can prematurely cut valid branches. The block
    if teams_in_use[0] + remaining_players > T:
        reuse_count = (teams_in_use[0] + remaining_players) - T
        if teams_in_use[0] < reuse_count:
            return
  is logically wrong: reuse_count is the number of remaining players that would have to be assigned to already-existing teams if every other remaining player created a new team, but that does not imply you need that many distinct existing teams (multiple players can be placed into the same existing team). As written this check will return from valid branches (for example at the root for N=6, T=4 it immediately returns), producing incorrect counts.
